.TH VALIDATE-INTAKE-SERIES-RECEIPT 1 "2026-07-25" "0.2.3"
.SH NAME
validate-intake-series-receipt.sh \- validate an intake-series receipt
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B validate-intake-series-receipt.sh
--file FILE [--repo PATH] [--json]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Validates receipt identity, operation authority, manifest hash binding,
supersession archives, deletion tombstones, and the referenced series manifest
without modifying files.
.PP
DE: Archivierte Vorgaenger werden mit ihrer Receipt-Operation und der
Manifeststruktur samt Abhaengigkeiten validiert. Historische Zieldateien
duerfen inzwischen verschoben sein; die archivierten Manifest-Bytes bleiben
ueber SHA-256 an den Receipt gebunden.
.PP
EN: Archived predecessors are checked for receipt authority and manifest graph
integrity. Historical target files may have moved; the archived manifest bytes
remain bound to the receipt by SHA-256.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 for valid evidence and 2 for invalid input or drift.
